text.pre:
IF(condition)
{
    <first block of statements>
}
ELSE
{
    <second block of statements>
}

FOR EACH item IN aList
{
  <block of statements>
}

essential-knowledge.text:
The exam reference sheet provides procName(arg1, arg2, ...) as a
way to call PROCEDURE procName(parameter1, parameter2, ...) {
<block of statements> } which takes zero or more arguments;
arg1 is assigned to parameter1, arg2 is assigned to parameter2,
and so on.
